# Contoh konfigurasi environment frontend.
#
# - `npm run dev`  -> membaca frontend/.env.development (sudah tersedia di repo,
#   VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:5000/api). Tidak perlu salin file ini.
# - `npm run build` -> memakai deteksi runtime di src/utils/api.js; JANGAN set
#   VITE_API_URL di .env / .env.production karena akan terbawa ke hasil build.
#
# Override pribadi (opsional): buat frontend/.env.development.local lalu isi:
# VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:5000/api
# VITE_MEDIA_URL=http://localhost:5000
